:"10-Q","filed":"2025-11-05"},"0000864749-26-000063":{"c":"TRMB","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-05-06"},"0000864749-26-000108":{"c":"TRMB","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-08-12"},"0000864749-26-000121":{"c":"TRMB","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-11-04"}},"finsights":{"TRMB":[{"topic":"fcf","text":"Free cash flow was $361 million in FY2025: operating cash flow of $386 million less capital spending of $25.3 million (computed from two filed figures). That is 10.1% of revenue. In FY2020 it was $615 million.","cites":["TRMB.ocf.2025","TRMB.capex.2025","TRMB.revenue.2025","TRMB.ocf.2020","TRMB.capex.2020"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $147 million in FY2025, 4.1% of revenue, against 2.6% in FY2020.","cites":["TRMB.sbc.2025","TRMB.revenue.2025","TRMB.sbc.2020","TRMB.revenue.2020"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2025 the company paid $863 million to repurchase its own shares. No dividend payment is tagged for the year.","cites":["TRMB.buybacks.2025"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-10-02 revenue was $967 million, up 7.3% from $901 million in the three months ended 2025-10-03.","cites":["TRMB.d.revenue.2026-07-04.2026-10-02","TRMB.d.revenue.2025-07-05.2025-10-03"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-10-02 revenue added up to $3.8 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $634 million and net income to -$157 million.","cites":["TRMB.d.revenue.2025-01-04.2026-01-02","TRMB.d.revenue.2025-01-04.2025-10-03","TRMB.d.revenue.2026-01-03.2026-04-03","TRMB.d.revenue.2026-04-04.2026-07-03","TRMB.d.revenue.2026-07-04.2026-10-02","TRMB.d.opinc.2025-01-04.2026-01-02","TRMB.d.opinc.2025-01-04.2025-10-03","TRMB.d.opinc.2026-01-03.2026-04-03","TRMB.d.opinc.2026-04-04.2026-07-03","TRMB.d.opinc.2026-07-04.2026-10-02","TRMB.d.netinc.2025-01-04.2026-01-02","TRMB.d.netinc.2025-01-04.2025-10-03","TRMB.d.netinc.2026-01-03.2026-04-03","TRMB.d.netinc.2026-04-04.2026-07-03","TRMB.d.netinc.2026-07-04.2026-10-02"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $798 million: operating cash flow of $825 million less capital spending of $26.7 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["TRMB.d.ocf.2025-01-04.2026-01-02","TRMB.d.ocf.2025-01-04.2025-10-03","TRMB.d.ocf.2026-01-03.2026-04-03","TRMB.d.ocf.2026-01-03.2026-07-03","TRMB.d.ocf.2026-01-03.2026-10-02","TRMB.d.capex.2025-01-04.2026-01-02","TRMB.d.capex.2025-01-04.2025-10-03","TRMB.d.capex.2026-01-03.2026-04-03","TRMB.d.capex.2026-01-03.2026-07-03","TRMB.d.capex.2026-01-03.2026-10-02"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $2 billion at the end of FY2025, against $1.7 billion a year earlier. That is 55.8% of FY2025 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["TRMB.rpo.2025","TRMB.rpo.2024","TRMB.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $999 million at the end of FY2025 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $896 million a year earlier.","cites":["TRMB.deferred.2025","TRMB.deferred.2024"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 11,500 in its own words. FY2025 revenue works out to about $312,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["TRMB.q.employees","TRMB.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2025 annual report tags restructuring charges of $19.3 million, after $15.9 million in FY2024.","cites":["TRMB.restructuring.2025","TRMB.restructuring.2024"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $253 million in cash and cash equivalents, and $1.4 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent). Debt less cash was $1.1 billion (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["TRMB.cash.2025","TRMB.debtLong.2025"]}]},"fin":{"TRMB":{}},"quotes":{"TRMB.q.employees":{"c":"TRMB","kind":"employees","n":11500,"quote":"At the end of 2025, we employed over 11,500 full-time and part-time employees, the overwhelming majority of which were full-time employees.","source":"TRMB-0000864749-26-000015","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-02-25","proof":"24ad32477251daca48d183449b782b4b3bd9fb09df9bb3dade1cfc5b34e04c96"}}}